#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:78 ef0e7258cf6641b89fd9a01ec9ac7862
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:80 a8b8745bc8094387a6b340cde34fb7f5
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART6. The SBUS pin is inverted "
"and connected to RX6. Non SBUS, single wire serial inputs can be directly "
"tied to RX6 if SBUS pin is left unconnected. RC could  be applied instead at"
" a different UART port such as UART1, UART4 or UART8, and set the protocol "
"to receive RC data: ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23`` and change SERIAL5 _Protocol to "
"something other than '23'."
msgstr ""
"默认 RC 输入配置在 UART6 上。SBUS 引脚经反相后连接至 RX6。非 SBUS 的单线串行输入，若 SBUS 引脚悬空，可直接连接至 "
"RX6。也可将 RC 改接至其他 UART 端口（如 UART1、UART4 或 UART8），并将对应协议设为 "
"``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23``，同时将 SERIAL5_Protocol 更改为非「23」的协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:83 ced9d5152d8c41e583c4125a8e9af527
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:85 cef3919c7298402a88c91ceffc0ce5ea
msgid ""
"The MicoAir743 supports onboard OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver). "
"Simultaneously, DisplayPort HD OSD is enabled by default and available on "
"the HD VTX connector, See below."
msgstr ""
"MicoAir743 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的板载 OSD。同时，DisplayPort 高清 OSD "
"默认启用，可通过高清图传接头使用，详见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:88 68c7b742624943059672db329667232d
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "图传支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:90 e29dd0c33b844da5bf643bb0c3f82a17
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol"
" defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 9v so be careful not to "
"connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P 接头支持 DJI Air Unit/高清图传连接。协议默认为 DisplayPort。接头的第 1 针为 9V，请勿将其连接到需要 "
"5V 的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:93 ff048b4320e34613869cf79f55cfee52
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:95 aac41f0a922d40c8a8abf4b28f6fc317
msgid ""
"The MicoAir743 supports up to 10 PWM outputs. All the channels support "
"DShot. Channels 1-8 support bi-directional DShot. PWM outputs are grouped "
"and every group must use the same output protocol:"
msgstr ""
"MicoAir743 最多支持 10 路 PWM 输出。所有通道均支持 DShot，通道 1-8 支持双向 DShot。PWM "
"输出按组划分，每组必须使用相同的输出协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:97 faa5d12e69fa4109bca4f445a9386053
msgid "1, 2, 3, 4 are Group 1"
msgstr "1、2、3、4 属于第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:98 4aace1ef8aa04984b68950d01ed6b558
msgid "5, 6 are Group 2"
msgstr "5、6 属于第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:99 1230a20f20e74fae9883ca3b32e2d1e5
msgid "7, 8, 9, 10 are Group 3"
msgstr "7、8、9、10 属于第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:101
#: cec204bb6ef74f79b53b1ed053cc7c3a
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从BetaflightX机架迁移的用户，前四路输出M1-M4已配置为使用现有电机接线，默认参数如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:103
#: 6d3f955b28234905b66d8bf4b7005051
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:104
#: 64295d9bd4004318b8f9fcf7eab01e48
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

