#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:123
#: 8e8296d488a04ab8975201bec550e11f
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:125
#: b19b343779404c858d2196c41538e5d9
msgid ""
"The MicoAir743 has a built-in compass sensor (IST8310), and you can also "
"attach an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL connector."
msgstr "MicoAir743 内置罗盘传感器（IST8310），也可通过 SDA 和 SCL 接头使用 I2C 连接外置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:128
#: f139b0e15aec46a4a6d5fc12651d6000
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:130
#: 75165c1cb11947a3828df871eddb96b6
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in  sub-folders labeled \"MicoAir743\"."
msgstr ""
"该飞控板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 的「MicoAir743」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:133
#: 3a1c5729444b4acbb1108b4279ed6744
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:135
#: abb6d9aa97a14162949ae5a345cc1390
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favorite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "首次固件加载可在按住引导程序按钮插入 USB 时通过 DFU 完成。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 烧写工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743.rst:137
#: 11c149ea71ef475f9ce893b0995c127f
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"\"\\*.apj\" firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用「\\*.apj」固件文件。"
